      "quote": "樞輔奪情，亦欲予變禮以分愆耶？處心若此，安可與事君。他日必面責之",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "自予與賊角，經數十百戰未嘗衄。今者，分疲卒五千，大敵西沖，援師東隔，事由中制，食盡力窮，旦夕死矣",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "麾兵疾戰，呼聲動天，自辰迄未",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "聞敗，倉皇遁，不言象昇死狀",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "予受國恩，恨不得死所，有如萬分一不幸，寧捐軀斷脰耳",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "麻衣白網巾",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "一門先後赴難者百餘人",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "袁崇煥之禍其能免乎",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "果然外廷議也，帝意銳甚矣",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "撫乃外廷議耳",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261"
    },
    {
      "book": "mingshi",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "quote": "愛才惜下如不及",
